Portions of packs.json and systems.json are derived from Open Design
Repository: https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design
Files: design-systems/<id>/DESIGN.md, tokens.css, manifest.json and components.manifest.json for every
system listed in CREDITS.md (commit 59e4f2ae85de7e7318a5e6bdcf3a34584c4b7582)
