The builders' craft rules (engine/prompts.mjs WORKER_SYSTEM) and the reviewer's AI-default look
(engine/review.mjs) are condensed, in our words, from Open Design's apps/daemon/src/prompts/core-slim.ts
("Design Craft") and craft/anti-ai-slop.md, craft/typography.md and craft/color.md (commit
59e4f2ae85de7e7318a5e6bdcf3a34584c4b7582, Apache-2.0; craft/ adapts referodesign/refero_skill, MIT). The
reviewer's 0-10 score, its pass mark of 8 and its 3 rounds follow the defaults of Open Design's Critique
Theater (packages/contracts/src/critique.ts); none of its code is used.
